t-semibold text-headline-gradient-horizontal">Enhanced Privacy and Controlled Access</h2><span class="text-body leading-body font-inter font-normal text-white/80">Where other tools default to open sharing, HackMD lets you control visibility with optional publishing, SAML login, and private access settings—perfect for sensitive or external collaboration.</span></div><div class="relative max-h-[300px] w-auto lg:col-start-1"><img alt="Privacy and access" loading="lazy" width="566" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-lg w-auto h-auto max-h-[300px]" style="color:transparent" src="/enterprise/005-Privacy.png"/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><h2 class="text-h2 leading-h2 font-readex-pro font-semibold text-headline-gradient-horizontal">Future-Proof Your Knowledge</h2><span class="text-body leading-body font-inter font-normal text-white/80">Ditch proprietary formats. HackMD uses open-source Markdown—forever free, portable, and AI-compatible. Your knowledge remains accessible, vendor-free, and ready for whatever comes next.</span></div><div class="relative max-h-[300px] w-auto"><img alt="Future proof" loading="lazy" width="566" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-lg w-auto h-auto max-h-[300px]" style="color:transparent" src="/enterprise/006-markdown.png"/></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-16 px-6"><div class="px-8 py-12 corner-radius-lg md:py-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat relative overflow-hidden bg-[url(&quot;/bg-gradient-light-purple-square.svg&quot;)] md:bg-[url(&quot;/bg-gradient-light-purple-rectangle.svg&quot;)] w-full"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900/10 to-blue-900/10"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h1 class="text-h1 l